//   Ã‚Â· On-delay     : alarm confirmed after ON_DELAY consecutive exceedances
//   Ã‚Â· Deadband     : clears only when value retreats DEADBAND_PCT% inside limit
//   Ã‚Â· State machine: NORMAL Ã¢â€ â€™ PENDING Ã¢â€ â€™ ACTIVE Ã¢â€ â€™ CLEARING
